Band Description: A trio of spectral transit-dwellers known as "The Linemen," who play behind frosted glass partitions. They dress in fraying wool coats woven with micro-fiberoptic wiring that pulses with the tempo of the music. Their performance is less a concert and more a tactile repair mission—they physically unravel lengths of conductive thread while performing, treating the room like a textile loom that they are slowly taking apart.

